# Internal workflow / guardrail files — kept LOCAL for the team, NOT pushed publicly.
# These drive the local dev process (and any internal agents) but are not part of the
# shipped product, so they are intentionally excluded from the public remote.
#
# NOTE: removing these from .gitignore would make them public. Keep them here.
AGENTS.md
SPEC.md
ROADMAP.md
TASKS.md

# CI workflow lives under .github/workflows/ and IS pushed publicly so GitHub
# Actions can auto-run lint/test/build on every push and PR. Do NOT ignore it —
# this is your automatic safety net. Remove nothing below.

# --- Frontend (Vite) ---
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

